# Proxy runtime state. whitelist.json is DATA-PLANE state, not config: the
# gateway serves only the addresses it lists, and since a client may now treat
# a whitelist refusal as "this chunk does not exist" (X-Chunk-Gate), losing or
# overwriting it makes real chunks read as absent. An empty stub committed here
# is a path to deploying one over a real one - never track it.
proxy/data/
